
  <sn><md>### Original "Hello, World!" in K&amp;R C

The following is the original **"Hello, World!"** program from *The C Programming Language* by **Brian Kernighan** and **Dennis Ritchie**, commonly known as **K&amp;R**. Dennis Ritchie was the original developer of the C programming language at Bell Labs.

**Original K&amp;R Program**

**Version:** K&amp;R

```c
#include <stdio.h>

main()
{
    printf("hello, world\n");
}
```
